    "title": "Panera Bread",
    "description": "Meet our NEW! Spicy Fiesta Chicken sandwich & Kickin\u2019 Grilled Cheese.  Try both in a You Pick Two or pair it with your go-to.\r\n\r\nThe Panera Bread app is like having a mini-Panera in your pocket, but even better! You\u2019ll find all your faves, classic and new\u2014and so. much. more:\r\n\r\nGet to the MMM faster.\r\nSkip the line! Order ahead for Rapid Pick-Up. Staying in? We\u2019ll deliver your flavor fix right to your door.\r\n \r\nYour rewards, your way.\r\nGet exclusive in-app deals and find all your MyPanera rewards in one place. Plus, choose your rewards based on what you\u2019re craving.\r\n \r\nJoin Unlimited Sip Club!  \r\nEnjoy access to 20+ drinks, exclusive perks and more. Already a member? Redeem your cups even faster in the app.  \r\n \r\nWe save your faves.\r\nYour go-to orders (customizations and all) are right at your fingertips so you can order it again, and again, and again...\r\n \r\nShare the YUM. Give them a gift card!\r\nSend them a coffee for their first day, a \u2018get well\u2019 soup, or a little extra love just because\u2014right from the app to their email inbox.\r\n\r\nWHAT'S NEW\r\nCalling all vegetarians and veg lovers! We added a curated menu full of no-meat options just for you. Plus, save on a whole lot of flavor with our Value Duets. Choose from a variety of set pairings for every craving.",
